      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive veterinarians and bilingual staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise Dr. Cooper and Dr. Branch for their thorough examinations, calm bedside manner, and clear medical advice. Clients appreciate that receptionists and veterinary technicians accommodate urgent visits and communicate in both English and Spanish, though a few reviewers noted occasional dismissive interactions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight the compassionate handling shown to both dogs and cats during wellness checkups and acute illnesses. Longtime clients mention that the medical team treats pets with patience and affection, helping keep nervous animals calm during diagnostic procedures, nail trims, and ongoing treatment regimens."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective medical and surgical treatment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report successful recoveries from serious conditions, including infectious illnesses and tumors, crediting the clinical team for finding workable medical solutions. Most reviewers note prompt improvement following prescribed therapies, while one visitor felt their pet's acute distress was not adequately resolved."
      }
    }
  ],
